{"id":"wb-7-270","name":"人和寨遗址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"人和寨遗址","text":"人和寨遗址是位于中国河南省新郑市辛店镇人和寨村西的古聚落遗址，地处双洎河南岸，发现有新砦期城址。它与新密新砦遗址、郑州牛砦遗址、巩义花地嘴遗址等，同属嵩山东部及其附近地区的新砦期代表性遗址。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%BA%BA%E5%92%8C%E5%AF%A8%E9%81%97%E5%9D%80","revisionId":95081451,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=95081451","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/67e0d3d2bbe1ee621b6c6bad.jpg","title":"20241011_Renhezhai_Site.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:20241011_Renhezhai_Site.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5e/20241011_Renhezhai_Site.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Windmemories","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​人和寨遗址文保标识","width":320,"height":213}}